  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUTPUT 3.2 SUSTAINABLE &amp; SAFE SANITATION AND HYGIENE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3.2 - Sustainable and Safe Sanitation &amp; Hygiene: The Government, stakeholders and communities at national and sub national
level demonstrate enhanced capacities to deliver evidence informed and adopt climate resilient and safely managed sanitation
services and safe hygiene practices, including at home, schools and health care facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
